From 53a99ed92101a787c87e3e57f121549b9100039d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reagan Bohan <xbjfk.github@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 May 2025 12:31:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 36/80] musl: struct ipc_perm: rename `__ipc_perm_key` to
 `__key`

This isn't strictly related to musl 1.2.3, however now presents a good
time to change it, before the 1.0 release.

(backport <https://github.com/rust-lang/libc/pull/4443>)
(cherry picked from commit 3f81aadb0f1d1381c78f9b49da5267b3c466b138)
